OL,3,GNEWSAEx-special constable sentenced
OL,4,Aover indecent images
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former special constable with
OL,7,FLeicestershire Police has been handed a
OL,8,Ftwo-year community order after
OL,9,Fadmitting making indecent images of
OL,10,Fchildren.
OL,12,FJamie Wallace, who had pleaded guilty
OL,13,Fto three counts, was sentenced at
OL,14,FLeicester Crown Court on Wednesday.
OL,16,FThe 22-year-old must sign the sex
OL,17,Foffenders register for five years, and
OL,18,Fwill be subject to a sexual harm
OL,19,Fprevention order for the same period.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
